.TH "libnvme_sed_l0_find" 9 "libnvme_sed_l0_find" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvme_sed_l0_find \- Find a Level 0 Discovery descriptor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "struct tcg_l0_desc *" libnvme_sed_l0_find
.BI "(void *buf "  ","
.BI "size_t len "  ","
.BI "__u16 code "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "buf" 12
Level 0 Discovery data
.IP "len" 12
Size of \fIbuf\fP in bytes
.IP "code" 12
Feature code, see \fIenum tcg_l0_code\fP
.SH "RETURN"
Pointer to the first descriptor with feature code \fIcode\fP, or
NULL if there is none.
